  "title": "2025 - Procurement News Round Up",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.procurementportal.com/blog/january-2025/2025-procurement-news-round-up/",
  "description": "As we head into 2025 and towards implementation of the Procurement Act 2023 on 24 February this year, we look at the latest templates, guidance, PPNs and draft legislation issued by government over the festive period.",
  "publication_date": null,
